portrait.text:
Use case: full-body character portrait for a study game (碧琪上岸记). Character: the pink pony shown in the attached reference images (bright pink body, voluminous curly magenta-pink mane and tail, big blue eyes, a cutie mark of exactly three balloons — one yellow, two blue — on her flank). Keep exactly the same flat cartoon style as the references: clean bold dark-magenta outlines, flat bright colors, minimal soft cel shading, cute, warm and friendly. Original costume design — do not copy any specific character from any existing franchise.
Costume and pose: {desc}
{extra}
Full body, standing in a confident lively three-quarter pose, all four hooves visible, the balloon cutie mark visible. Square 1024x1024 composition, character centered with generous margin, nothing cropped.
Papercraft stand-up treatment: the whole figure and props are surrounded by one continuous thick clean WHITE die-cut border (about 8px at 512px size) with a very subtle soft grey drop shadow, like a pop-up-book paper figure / planner sticker. Isolated on a fully transparent background (if transparency is impossible, use plain flat pure white).
No text, no letters, no numbers, no watermark, no frame, no background scenery.

